  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nOnline payments\n\nOnline collection and manual payouts. New kiosk QR payments carry the Jamanvaar fee.\n\nRefresh\nGROSS COLLECTED\n₹0.00\nJAMANVAAR FEE (3% KIOSK QR)\n₹0.00\nREFUNDED TO CUSTOMERS\n₹0.00\nNET PAYABLE TO YOU\n₹0.00\nWhere the collection went\nTo you (net of refunds)\n₹0.00\nJamanvaar fee (kept on refunds)\n₹0.00\nRefunded to customers\n₹0.00\n\nFee is kept on refunds. Your share of a refunded payment is taken back: ₹0.00.\n\nRefunds by how they were paid back\nCash\n₹0.00\nUPI from owner\n₹0.00\nGross Collection / Jamanvaar Fee / Net Payable (all time)\nGross Collection\n₹0.00\n− Jamanvaar Fee (kiosk QR only; rate saved per payment)\n− ₹0.00\n= Net Payable after holds\n₹0.00\nAlready paid to your bank\n₹0.00\nPending (not yet transferred)\n₹0.00\nRazorpay Route is pending, so Jamanvaar collects payments on your behalf and pays your net amount to your bank by manual transfer once verified — this is not money already in your account.\n\nNo online payments yet.\n\nToday's Gross Collection / Fee / Net Payable\nShow\nDownload CSV\nGross Collection (0 payments)\n₹0.00\nJamanvaar Fee (kiosk QR only)\n₹0.00\nRefunds (0)\n₹0.00\nHeld for refund review\n₹0.00\nNet Payable after holds (before payouts)\n₹0.00\nJamanvaar collects payments; verified bank accounts receive manual payouts. Refund-related shares are held for reconciliation while the refund fee policy is pending. Route is not enabled yet. Day = calendar day in India time.\nKiosk payment settings\nRefresh\n\nKiosk QR payments collect into Jamanvaar's account. Your net payable is transferred manually after your bank details are verified.\n\nOnline payments: NOT CONNECTED\n\nJamanvaar Fee: 3.00% on kiosk QR payments only. Super Admin controls this rate.\n\nCurrent collection account: Jamanvaar\n\nCurrent payout mode: Manual bank transfer\n\nRequest online payment activation\nRequest direct settlement to my bank\n\nRazorpay Route is pending. This toggle saves your request for later activation; payments continue through Jamanvaar with manual payouts. Save your bank details before enabling it.\n\nPayout bank: NOT_ADDED\nUpdate bank details\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
